; A v8i32 sum of products of such loads, the taps of a filter: the terms are
; ordered by shift amount (then offset) and moved to their adds, so that the
; loads of a shift share one MTSAB, and the loads are rebased also with more
; than two shift amounts.
define <8 x i32> @taps(<8 x i32> %c0, <8 x i32> %c1, <8 x i32> %c2, <8 x i32> %c3, <8 x i32> %c4) {
